      ":question/problem": "The volume of water in a tank was recorded over time for $25$ minutes, starting from time $t=0$ minutes. The following table shows the volume $V(t)$, in liters, recorded at time $t.$\n\n| $t$ | $0$ | $5$ | $10$ | $15$ | $20$ | $25$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $V(t)$ | $120$ | $150$ | $165$ | $180$ | $215$ | $240$ |\n\nApproximate the rate of change of volume at time $t=5$ using a forward difference approximation. Do not round the answer.\n\nAt $t=5,$ the estimated rate of change is {{field-1}} liters per minute."
