      ":question/problem": "A hiker\u2019s elevation was recorded over time for $6$ hours, starting from time $t=0$ hours. The following table shows the elevation $E(t)$, in meters, recorded at time $t.$\n\n| $t$ | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ | $3$ | $4$ | $5$ | $6$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $E(t)$ | $0$ | $200$ | $310$ | $395$ | $450$ | $525$ | $600$ |\n\nApproximate the rate of change of elevation at time $t=1$ using a forward difference approximation. Do not round the answer.\n\nAt $t=1,$ the estimated rate of change is {{field-1}} meters per hour."
